			"date": "2024-04-23T14:31:02.268Z",
			"content": "<p>Notably, Vercel has a financial incentive to *not* implement support for a bunch of features in static export in Next.js.</p><p>Either static export is a viable feature for portable Next.js projects or Next.js is not a portable framework.</p>",
