			"date": "2024-04-23T15:17:09.617Z",
			"content": "<p>For me, it’s hard not to see the larger problem (and not limited to Vercel).</p><p>Hosting providers are prioritizing dynamic features because dynamic things make more money!</p><p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://hachyderm.io/@jlengstorf\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>jlengstorf</span></a></span> said it first: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/tf2erRqdwqc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"\">youtube.com/shorts/tf2erRqdwqc</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a> on <a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/tags/TheFutureOfJamstack\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>TheFutureOfJamstack</span></a></p>",
