			"date": "2024-04-23T18:45:35.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> You can view source on this guy: <a href=\"https://alan.norbauer.com/articles/disable-source-maps\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">alan.norbauer.com/articles/dis</span><span class=\"invisible\">able-source-maps</span></a> to see</p><p>(Sorry, on my phone atm)</p>",
