			},
			"date": "2024-04-23T21:25:12.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I'm still not sure what Vercel is trying to solve except lock customers in to a ecosystem they will just keep deprecating</p><p>Honestly an Astro, 11ty, or even Express + template library - inside a docker container - is a much better solution.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
